<div class="credits"><div class="tcard bay"><span class="tk">Series</span><span class="tn">The Bay</span><span class="tc">cues on his SoundCloud marked TB</span><span class="tcues"><span>TB EP20 1M3</span></span></div><div class="tcard war"><span class="tk">Film</span><span class="tn">War Flowers</span><span class="tc">cues on his SoundCloud marked WF</span><span class="tcues"><span>WF 1M25</span><span>WF 2M14</span></span></div><div class="tcard gauntlet"><span class="tk">Film</span><span class="tn">The Gauntlet</span><span class="tc">cues on his SoundCloud marked TG</span><span class="tcues"><span>TG 2M1</span><span>TG 3M3</span><span>TG 3M10</span><span>TG 4M1</span></span></div></div>
<p class="scnote">His own site leads with the posters of these three productions. His SoundCloud cues carry the initials TB, WF and TG, which match the three titles; his exact role on each is <span class="tbc">to confirm</span>. The posters belong to the productions, so here they are title cards drawn for this site.<sup class="s"><a href="#s9">9</a></sup> <a class="imdb" href="https://www.imdb.com/name/nm4704147/">IMDb</a></p>
